MQ2A-uGI2Q/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/Misce9d7UT0/s40-c-k-mo/photo.jpg"],[[null,[[["Artificial intelligence can create beautiful backyard images in seconds. With just a few prompts, you can see custom pools, paver patios, outdoor kitchens, fire features, landscape lighting, and lush planting plans come to life on a screen. It's an exciting way to explore ideas, but there's one important question every homeowner should ask: Can AI truly design a backyard that fits the way you live?\nAt Outdoor Spaces, we believe every great outdoor space begins with understanding the people who will use it, not just the technology used to design it. AI is a valuable tool that can help homeowners visualize possibilities, but it should never replace the experience, collaboration, and thoughtful planning that go into creating a custom backyard. It can't walk your property, understand your home's architecture, evaluate drainage, account for changing elevations, or learn how your family wants to spend time outside.\nEvery outdoor living project is unique. The placement of a custom pool, the flow between a paver patio and an outdoor kitchen, the privacy created through planting design, and even the placement of landscape lighting all influence how the space will look, feel, and function for years to come. That's why the Outdoor Spaces team takes the time to understand your property, goals, and lifestyle before creating a design that brings it all together. If you're ready to move beyond inspiration, our team is here to help turn your vision into a reality.",1]]],[1793973265,1809784463],null,[5,"http://outdoorspacesky.com/","Learn more",5,1],[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipNQPwdrQCefIs2XdwUplHQHSL2bl2eXSQT3q1i9\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipNQPwdrQCefIs2XdwUplHQHSL2bl2eXSQT3q1i9"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipNhXhkg5Eky6YX8w3umICA3JxHZHIrMDmvh2c9E\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipNhXhkg5Eky6YX8w3umICA3JxHZHIrMDmvh2c9E"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipN5P4lVOFR-W4146lHdhRv4TOk9WSipxWWfQtt6\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipN5P4lVOFR-W4146lHdhRv4TOk9WSipxWWfQtt6"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipOCe9u2WmfcBOrrmozBtOTBiKniZGaYrfmqj8Cw\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipOCe9u2WmfcBOrrmozBtOTBiKniZGaYrfmqj8Cw"]],"5745619631498821289","13883070578812691709",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003ddf276e43d8e6818b\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003den\u0026gl\u003dus\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCAIQACoeChxtc3BfaDpwQmFGa0dpVnF2cE8yTzBhN0w1Q0NR\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CAIQACoeChxtc3BfaDpwQmFGa0dpVnF2cE8yTzBhN0w1Q0NR,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F13883070578812691709%2FlocalPosts%2F5745619631498821289/version/1793973263237000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCKn9_e_P06LeTxIwQ0FJUUFDb2VDaHh0YzNCZmFEcHdRbUZHYTBkcFZuRjJjRTh5VHpCaE4wdzFRME5SGgswZXZTa0duYkg3cA\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCAIQACoeChxtc3BfaDpwQmFGa0dpVnF2cE8yTzBhN0w1Q0NR\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5VymQBGXIdw0M1yngrywTW6","2ahUKEwi-v6jLx4yYAxWBBbkGHSw3OKQQ544CKCB6BQgBEI4B",null,"Nov 6, 2026",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u13883070578812691709/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM1NzQ1NjE5NjMxNDk4ODIxMjg5","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u13883070578812691709/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM1NzQ1NjE5NjMxNDk4ODIxMjg5",null,null,null,null,null,["5745619631498821289","CAIQACoeChxtc3BfaDpwQmFGa0dpVnF2cE8yTzBhN0w1Q0NR","0evSkGnbH7p"],null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/promote/updates/5745619631498821289/edit"],[null,[[["Creating a custom pool is about much more than choosing a shape, size or material. It is a process that starts with understanding how the space will be used and how the pool will fit into a larger backyard design. The goal is not just to install a pool, but to create a complete outdoor living space that feels intentional from the start.\nAt Outdoor Spaces, every custom pool project begins with a conversation. We look at your property's layout, your home's architecture, and how you want to experience the space day to day. Factors like elevation, sun exposure, access points, and surrounding features all play a role in shaping the design.\nFrom there, the design-build process brings everything together to create a plan tailored to your home. A custom pool is planned alongside patios, walkways, outdoor kitchens, fire features, and landscape design to ensure the entire backyard works as one cohesive environment. Whether your space has existing elements or starting from scratch, our team can create a plan to achieve your dream backyard. \nBehind the scenes, each decision is made with intention. The placement of the pool, the materials used, and how each element connects all contribute to how the space will feel once it is complete.\nWhen the process is done right, the result is more than a pool. It is a backyard designed to support how you live, relax, and enjoy your home every day.",1]]],[1789484400,1801064973],null,[5,"http://outdoorspacesky.com/","Learn more",5,1],[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMUgVYbmC7caoBeY0SFOm5KSbFC6-JXdJUNTrrh\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipMUgVYbmC7caoBeY0SFOm5KSbFC6-JXdJUNTrrh"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMyOjFJZ5zr1WiTdbJYyL8deHI8dvvrFxKfeT56\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipMyOjFJZ5zr1WiTdbJYyL8deHI8dvvrFxKfeT56"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipNiZNuMseVdBjWt6M6J-5gfwPSrO9dCFmgwZM8-\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipNiZNuMseVdBjWt6M6J-5gfwPSrO9dCFmgwZM8-"]],"8562832949516783509","13883070578812691709",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003ddf276e43d8e6818b\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003den\u0026gl\u003dus\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEN7Dm5forPWIhQE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEN7Dm5forPWIhQE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F13883070578812691709%2FlocalPosts%2F8562832949516783509/version/1785253773333000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCJWf1Zey5tLqdhIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFTjdEbTVmb3JQV0loUUUaEkNnc0lqcC1qMHdZUXlNaXJaQQ\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEN7Dm5forPWIhQE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5VymQBGXIdw0M1yngrywTW6","2ahUKEwi-v6jLx4yYAxWBBbkGHSw3OKQQ544CKCF6BQgBEI8B",null,"Sep 15, 2026",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u13883070578812691709/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM4NTYyODMyOTQ5NTE2NzgzNTA5","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u13883070578812691709/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM4NTYyODMyOTQ5NTE2NzgzNTA5",null,null,null,null,null,["8562832949516783509","CIHM0ogKEN7Dm5forPWIhQE","CgsIjp-j0wYQyMirZA"],null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/promote/updates/8562832949516783509/edit"],[null,[[["Many outdoor spaces are designed for occasional use, but the most successful ones are built for everyday living. When a backyard only feels useful for gatherings or special events, it often goes underused the rest of the time.\nAt Outdoor Spaces, we design custom outdoor living spaces around how people actually live. That starts with understanding your daily routines, how you move through your home, and what would make your backyard easier to enjoy on a regular basis. Through thoughtful backyard design and a design-build approach, we create spaces that bring together patios, walkways, custom pools, outdoor kitchens, and fire features in a way that feels both functional and comfortable.\nLayout plays a major role in how often a space is used. A well-placed patio, natural transitions between walkways, and intentional seating areas make it easier to step outside without overthinking it. Features like landscape lighting, retaining walls, planting design, and shade structures help create an inviting environment throughout the day while also adding structure and long-term value.\nThe goal is not to create a space used only a few times a year, but one that naturally becomes part of your routine. Whether it is a quiet morning outside, time with family, or unwinding after a long day, your outdoor space should feel accessible and easy to enjoy.\nWhen outdoor living is designed around real life, your backyard becomes a place you return to without effort.",1]]],[1786978800,1801064858],null,[5,"http://outdoorspacesky.com/","Learn more",5,1],[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipP8qUYC4KzrbRKvHnXJs5m72Gm5vYRfMhuQwi3t\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipP8qUYC4KzrbRKvHnXJs5m72Gm5vYRfMhuQwi3t"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipOEqLJxKudQJ9Vjk7cknu0WtmqDvl-FcQRFF09_\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipOEqLJxKudQJ9Vjk7cknu0WtmqDvl-FcQRFF09_"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipPs9_5b2vX1_JsWNxt4CjaVCyqC6FQCe2qk3R7X\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipPs9_5b2vX1_JsWNxt4CjaVCyqC6FQCe2qk3R7X"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipNZ0718khpj3kXVrzind4ZV7lkr3T3YFP9RzUAq\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipNZ0718khpj3kXVrzind4ZV7lkr3T3YFP9RzUAq"]],"3216486880008832492","13883070578812691709",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003ddf276e43d8e6818b\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003den\u0026gl\u003dus\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKENzTraTOy-uilgE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKENzTraTOy-uilgE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F13883070578812691709%2FlocalPosts%2F3216486880008832492/version/1785253658671000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCOyLhp3puNDRLBIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFTnpUcmFUT3ktdWlsZ0UaEkNnc0luSjZqMHdZUTBNX2FTZw\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKENzTraTOy-uilgE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5VymQBGXIdw0M1yngrywTW6","2ahUKEwi-v6jLx4yYAxWBBbkGHSw3OKQQ544CKCJ6BQgBEJAB",null,"Aug 17, 2026",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u13883070578812691709/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMzMjE2NDg2ODgwMDA4ODMyNDky","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u13883070578812691709/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMzMjE2NDg2ODgwMDA4ODMyNDky",null,null,null,null,null,["3216486880008832492","CIHM0ogKENzTraTOy-uilgE","CgsInJ6j0wYQ0M_aSg"],null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/promote/updates/3216486880008832492/edit"],[null,[[["A well-designed outdoor space should feel like a natural extension of your home, not a separate area you step into occasionally. When layout, materials, and scale are thoughtfully considered, your backyard becomes another place to relax, gather, and look forward to spending time each day.\nAt Outdoor Spaces, we approach outdoor design with your home and your lifestyle in mind. The goal is not just to add features, but to create a cohesive outdoor living space through thoughtful backyard design that connects seamlessly to how you already live inside. That might mean aligning a custom patio with your main living area, improving access from the kitchen, or creating a layout that feels natural to move through.\nMaterial selection plays a major role in that connection. Using complementary textures, colors, and finishes helps the outdoor space feel intentional rather than added on. Elevation and layout also guide how the space is experienced, ensuring transitions feel natural from one area to the next. A thoughtful outdoor design also considers how the space will be used over time. From quiet mornings outside to evenings with friends, your backyard should effortlessly support everyday life.\nWhen your outdoor space is designed with intention, it becomes more than an upgrade. It becomes a natural extension of your home, shaped around how you live.",1]]],[1785253540,1801064739],null,[5,"http://outdoorspacesky.com/","Learn more",5,1],[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMH1H-zA1a8U99bqdaeWaNcQikwFQRSh2-PiEsv\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipMH1H-zA1a8U99bqdaeWaNcQikwFQRSh2-PiEsv"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMxpwbzjo07tg6PSJeIpucmoR-Znz_UtYkXp88i\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipMxpwbzjo07tg6PSJeIpucmoR-Znz_UtYkXp88i"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipOXRLqFrBTuY3yFX5QsOXhUL_JNZ4UN91WJz8Ap\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipOXRLqFrBTuY3yFX5QsOXhUL_JNZ4UN91WJz8Ap"]],"168814510346135577","13883070578812691709",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003ddf276e43d8e6818b\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003den\u0026gl\u003dus\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEJKNvKKT8ue9Ww\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEJKNvKKT8ue9Ww,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F13883070578812691709%2FlocalPosts%2F168814510346135577/version/1785253539263000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCJnQ89Dx_O-rAhIWQ0lITTBvZ0tFSktOdktLVDh1ZTlXdxoSQ2dzSXBKMmowd1lRNE5qMmNn\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEJKNvKKT8ue9Ww\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5VymQBGXIdw0M1yngrywTW6","2ahUKEwi-v6jLx4yYAxWBBbkGHSw3OKQQ544CKCN6BQgBEJEB",null,"Jul 28, 2026",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u13883070578812691709/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChIxNjg4MTQ1MTAzNDYxMzU1Nzc%3D","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u13883070578812691709/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChIxNjg4MTQ1MTAzNDYxMzU1Nzc%3D",null,null,null,null,null,["168814510346135577","CIHM0ogKEJKNvKKT8ue9Ww","CgsIpJ2j0wYQ4Nj2cg"],null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/promote/updates/168814510346135577/edit"],[null,[[["A backyard pool is exciting to plan, but choosing the right location involves much more than finding an open spot in the yard. Unlike warmer climates, where pools are used nearly year-round, Kentucky pools experience all four seasons. That means your pool design should work just as well when the pool is closed for winter as it does during the peak of summer. \nA thoughtful landscape design considers where gathering spaces, outdoor kitchens, fireplaces, fire pits, and covered structures fit into the overall layout so your backyard remains useful in every season.\nThe challenge many homeowners face is balancing recreation, entertaining, and everyday functionality. Elevation changes, drainage needs, privacy, shade patterns, entry points from the home, and even pet traffic can all influence the ideal location for a swimming pool. The right design creates natural flow between your pool, patio, and other outdoor features.\nAt Outdoor Spaces, we help homeowners design custom pools, paver patios, concrete pool decks, landscaping, and customized outdoor design layouts that work together as one cohesive plan. We consider practical details like winter pool covers, year-round plantings, and how your family will use the space beyond summer swimming season. With the right pool and landscape design, your outdoor space can become one of the most enjoyed areas of your home year after year. If you're ready to make the most of your backyard, the team at Outdoor Spaces is here to help.",1]]],[1782227276,1798038474],null,[5,"http://outdoorspacesky.com/","Learn more",5,1],[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipP3cDNdpNC3N_p6bGTrbgp5cfiDyB_hfcmNK6MD\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipP3cDNdpNC3N_p6bGTrbgp5cfiDyB_hfcmNK6MD"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMTyXnSnA2h63a4n9SibKUvyoaHlrPXaCLC9src\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipMTyXnSnA2h63a4n9SibKUvyoaHlrPXaCLC9src"]],"4262809831072200025","13883070578812691709",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003ddf276e43d8e6818b\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003den\u0026gl\u003dus\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEPXC9YO_md_f_wE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEPXC9YO_md_f_wE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F13883070578812691709%2FlocalPosts%2F4262809831072200025/version/1782227274439000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCNnq5_DL3qKUOxIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFUFhDOVlPX21kX2Zfd0UaE0Nnd0l6TUxxMFFZUWtLN2pvZ0k\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEPXC9YO_md_f_wE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5VymQBGXIdw0M1yngrywTW6","2ahUKEwi-v6jLx4yYAxWBBbkGHSw3OKQQ544CKCR6BQgBEJIB",null,"Jun 23, 2026",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u13883070578812691709/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM0MjYyODA5ODMxMDcyMjAwMDI1","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u13883070578812691709/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM0MjYyODA5ODMxMDcyMjAwMDI1",null,null,null,null,null,["4262809831072200025","CIHM0ogKEPXC9YO_md_f_wE","CgwIzMLq0QYQkK7jogI"],null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/promote/updates/4262809831072200025/edit"],[null,[[["A lot of backyards have potential, they just don’t get used the way homeowners may have hoped. Maybe it feels disconnected, hard to access, or like there’s nowhere comfortable to host, play, and relax. You step outside, but you don’t necessarily spend more time than you need to.\nAt Outdoor Spaces, we start by understanding how you actually want to use your backyard. Not just what you want it to look like, but how it should feel at the end of a long day or on a quiet weekend morning.\nIn many cases, it comes down to layout. A raised deck might make the yard below feel separate, or the space may not flow in a way that invites you to move through it. But when you add an outdoor kitchen, seating features, or shaded areas, you and your family can gather and use more of your backyard. That’s where thoughtful backyard design makes a difference. \nOur design-build process focuses on creating outdoor living spaces that fit your routine, not just your property. We look at how everything connects, from access points to seating areas, so the space works without you having to think about it.\nWhen it’s done right, your backyard becomes a place you naturally want to spend time in. That’s the goal. And it’s something Outdoor Spaces helps homeowners create every day. If you’re thinking about your backyard but aren't sure where to start, our team is here to guide you.\n",1]]],[1779453602,1795264801],null,[5,"http://outdoorspacesky.com/","Learn more",5,1],[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMA9u__-DqUcuNnyrMPU5n5ODAZkk6wI6leT143\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipMA9u__-DqUcuNnyrMPU5n5ODAZkk6wI6leT143"],["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipM9W29KT1WriLV-8hIZufmEurzYuxZtPyo8_8s_\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipM9W29KT1WriLV-8hIZufmEurzYuxZtPyo8_8s_"]],"2821080120518822960","13883070578812691709",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003ddf276e43d8e6818b\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003den\u0026gl\u003dus\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003dOutdoor+Spaces\u0026ludocid\u003d15180395216101424423\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEJa48qWTmMXXlgE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEJa48qWTmMXXlgE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F13883070578812691709%2FlocalPosts