KAd6BAgBEHI",null,null,null,null,null,3,[[1]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["en"],[["I can’t say enough good about Outdoor Spaces. After  hearing my ideas for the backyard and what I hoped to achieve, Trey Miller came up with a fantastic design, presented in a very nice drawing. He took into account what kind of sun each part of my backyard gets during the day and suggested appropriate plants that would do well with the available lighting. On one side of the backyard, that gets minimal sunlight, he planted shade appropriate plants that will thrive in that environment. I wish I had included a before picture so you could see how hard a time the grass was having in that area. I especially love the steppingstones, and when everything fills in, it will be absolutely lovely back there. He also built a wooden partition, hiding the outdoor HVAC unit and two propane tanks. My existing flowerbeds along the back fence and screened in porch were in need of Springtime refurbishing and re-mulching. He cleaned up those areas, cutting back the Liriope and Catmint so they could grow and be beautiful again this year. I was very impressed with his landscaping crew, a group of very hard-working, polite men, who were professional and meticulous in their work. If you are in need of anything to do with landscaping around your home, look no further than Outdoor Spaces. They will always be my first and only choice and recommendation.",null,[0,237]]]],[null,1776171553000000,1776171553000000,"7 months ago",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfNk12V3FBZXh1eFRNSUpVbDZ5M0hjZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfNk12V3FBZXh1eFRNSUpVbDZ5M0hjZxoTQ2d3SW9mVDR6Z1lRbV9EUThBRQ\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1",null,null,"2ahUKEwi-v6jLx4yYAxWBBbkGHSw3OKQQ_2MoCHoECAEQeg"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZVdKcVpFVmtXRnBHWTNwWmVGRjZaR0ZOZWxZMFVtMTBWRk15WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZVdKcVpFVmtXRnBHWTNwWmVGRjZaR0ZOZWxZMFVtMTBWRk15WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZVdKcVpFVmtXRnBHWTNwWmVGRjZaR0ZOZWxZMFVtMTBWRk15WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZVdKcVpFVmtXRnBHWTNwWmVGRjZaR0ZOZWxZMFVtMTBWRk15WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZVdKcVpFVmtXRnBHWTNwWmVGRjZaR0ZOZWxZMFVtMTBWRk15WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrZVdKcVpFVmtXRnBHWTNwWmVGRjZaR0ZOZWxZMFVtMTBWRk15WXhBQhAA"],null,["en"],[["Thank you so much for your thoughtful review of Outdoor Spaces. We’re so glad Trey was able to bring your vision to life with a design that truly fits your backyard and lighting conditions. It’s great to hear that the plant selections, stepping stones, and overall layout are coming together in a way you love. Our team takes pride in creating outdoor living spaces that are both functional and beautiful, and we appreciate you recognizing the care that went into every detail of your project.",null,[0,235]]]],[null,null,504,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21keWJqZEVkWFpGY3pZeFF6ZGFNelY0Um10VFMyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd2ab990515c3bd27!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmdybjdEdXZFczYxQzdaMzV4RmtTS2c%7C%7C?hl\u003den-US"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21keWJqZEVkWFpGY3pZeFF6ZGFNelY0Um10VFMyYxAB\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d1\u0026wv\u003d1",null,null,"2ahUKEwi-v6jLx4yYAxWBBbkGHSw3OKQQoykoCXoEC