ings I can say about Outdoor Spaces.  Dave and Wendy listened to all of our needs and ideas and helped us create a design that not only fit our budget, but exceeded our expectations for function and beauty. They were both so patient and never pressured us into any decisions. Once our project began, Trey, Taylor, and the entire crew went above and beyond to make sure we were informed and completely satisfied every step of the way. I have never seen such a hard-working, efficient, and friendly crew. We couldn't be happier and we're looking forward to working with them again in the future.",null,[0,237]]]],[null,1778508131000000,1778508131000000,"6 months ago",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfWi0xSmMxNGFZek1jVDVVS1RNRm5UQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfWi0xSmMxNGFZek1jVDVVS1RNRm5UQRoSQ2dzSTQ4S0gwQVlRby1DS1ZB\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1",null,null,"2ahUKEwi-v6jLx4yYAxWBBbkGHSw3OKQQ_2MoBHoFCAEQhAE"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPZUdNeFFteGFiVXBPWXpGV1VsWlZlRWRYYm13eVZGZGtSV051WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPZUdNeFFteGFiVXBPWXpGV1VsWlZlRWRYYm13eVZGZGtSV051WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPZUdNeFFteGFiVXBPWXpGV1VsWlZlRWRYYm13eVZGZGtSV051WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPZUdNeFFteGFiVXBPWXpGV1VsWlZlRWRYYm13eVZGZGtSV051WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13883070578812691709/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPZUdNeFFteGFiVXBPWXpGV1VsWlZlRWRYYm13eVZGZGtSV051WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13883070578812691709/cus